description:
Adventure Game Studio (AGS) provides the tools to make your own adventure, for free!


This is a stable 3.6.3 release. The contents of this update are listed in Changes.txt as usual.
If you're making games with this, please be sure to read "Upgrading to 3.6.3" article in the manual.
